    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you probably have to say that disclaimer stuff but i'm just looking for the general upper limit for an adult. i'm not asking for a prescription, just what is considered the max amount someone can take in 24 hours without it being dangerously high? i just need to know the ceiling so i don't go over it while trying to manage this pain.",
